---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-steel-dark/40 bg-graphite-2">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14">
		<div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
			<div>
				<p class="font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-ivory">
					Salt<span class="text-temper-gold">&</span>Iron
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm text-steel">
					A unisex hair studio and spa in a converted metal shop in the River Arts District.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="font-mono text-sm text-plaster">
				<p class="mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-steel">Visit</p>
				<p>142 Clingman Ave</p>
				<p>Asheville, NC 28801</p>
				<p class="mt-3">
					<a href="tel:+18285550142" class="hover:text-temper-gold">(828) 555-0142</a>
				</p>
				<p><a href="mailto:hello@saltandironavl.com" class="hover:text-temper-gold">hello@saltandironavl.com</a></p>
			</div>

			<div class="font-mono text-sm text-plaster">
				<p class="mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-steel">Hours</p>
				<p>Tue&ndash;Fri &nbsp; 9a&ndash;7p</p>
				<p>Sat &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9a&ndash;5p</p>
				<p>Sun&ndash;Mon &nbsp; Closed</p>
				<p class="mt-3">
					<a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-temper-gold"
						>@saltandiron.avl</a
					>
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="steel-rail my-8"></div>

		<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs text-steel sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
			<p>&copy; {year} Salt &amp; Iron Salon + Spa</p>
			<p>Concept site by Noel Ngerem &middot; not a real business</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
